<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπληθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very full of people</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.405
				</span></i>
			 ; of a speech, <i>full of matter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>very full</i> or <i>large</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάρξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				25
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>very full of</i> a thing, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.494
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.23
				</span></i>
			 : c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.796
			</span></i>, al.</div>
